@MyAppWeb_HostAddress = http://localhost:8080

### Message log served by /watch
GET {{MyAppWeb_HostAddress}}/watch
Accept: application/json

### Round-trips a save/load object through JSON
GET {{MyAppWeb_HostAddress}}/json
Accept: application/json

### Seeds a test product
POST {{MyAppWeb_HostAddress}}/addproduct
Accept: application/json

### Lists the stored products
GET {{MyAppWeb_HostAddress}}/getproducts
Accept: application/json

### Health probe used by the compose healthcheck
GET {{MyAppWeb_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Datastore version probes
GET {{MyAppWeb_HostAddress}}/postgres
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{MyAppWeb_HostAddress}}/mongo
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{MyAppWeb_HostAddress}}/sqlite
Accept: application/json
